[{"id": "19", "text": "⑴ $5\\,\\mathrm{c}m$  ⑵ $\\frac{\\sqrt{74}}{2}$$\\,\\mathrm{c}m$⑴ 학생$\\mathrm{A}$$\\mathrm{B}$$\\mathrm{C}$$\\mathrm{D}$편차(점)$3$$-2$$-6$편차의 합은 항상 $0$이므로 $\\mathrm{D}$의 편차는 $5\\,\\mathrm{c}m$이다.따라서 $\\mathrm{D}$의 키는 평균보다 $5\\,\\mathrm{c}m$ 더 크다.⑵ (분산)$=\\frac{3^{2}+\\left( -2\\right) ^{2}+\\left( -6\\right) ^{2}+5^{2}}{4}$$=\\frac{74}{4}$이므로(표준편차)$=\\sqrt{\\frac{74}{4}}$$=$$\\frac{\\sqrt{74}}{2}$$\\,\\mathrm{c}m$", "spans": 21}, {"id": "20", "text": "$\\frac{21}{2}$$4$개의 자료 $a,~b,~3,~7$에서(평균)$=\\frac{a+b+3+7}{4}$$=5$, $a+b=10$(분산)$=\\frac{\\left( a-5\\right) ^{2}+\\left( b-5\\right) ^{2}+\\left( 3-5\\right) ^{2}+\\left( 7-5\\right) ^{2}}{4}$$=12$, $\\left( a-5\\right) ^{2}+\\left( b-5\\right) ^{2}=40$$4$개의 자료 $a,~b,~4,~6$에서(평균)$=\\frac{a+b+4+6}{4}$$=\\frac{20}{4}=5$(분산)$=\\frac{\\left( a-5\\right) ^{2}+\\left( b-5\\right) ^{2}+\\left( 4-5\\right) ^{2}+\\left( 6-5\\right) ^{2}}{4}$$=\\frac{42}{4}=$$\\frac{21}{2}$", "spans": 16}, {"id": "21", "text": "$x=3.2$, $y=3.85$$\\sin \\,50°=0.77$, $\\cos \\,50°=0.64$이므로$\\cos \\,50°=\\frac{x}{5}$에서 $x=5\\times \\mathrm{\\cos }\\,50°$$=5\\times 0.64=3.2$$\\sin \\,50°=\\frac{y}{5}$에서 $y=5\\times \\mathrm{\\sin }\\,\\,50°$$=5\\times 0.77=3.85$", "spans": 10}, {"id": "22", "text": "$\\sin \\,x=\\frac{4}{5}$, $\\tan \\,y=\\frac{3}{4}$$\\overline{\\mathrm{A}B}$$=\\sqrt{3^{2}+4^{2}}=\\sqrt{25}=5$$\\,\\left( \\mathrm{c}m\\right)$이고 $\\angle x$$=\\angle \\mathrm{B}$, $\\angle y$$=\\angle \\mathrm{A}$이므로$\\sin \\,x$$=\\sin \\,B=\\frac{4}{5}$, $\\tan \\,y$$=\\tan \\,A=\\frac{3}{4}$", "spans": 13}]